  "all_ingredients_flat": "firm tofu, turmeric powder, paprika, tahini, nutritional yeast, plant-based milk, kala namak (Himalayan Black Salt), red onion, jalape\u00f1o, Ezekiel 4:9 bread",
  "instructions": "CRUMBLED TOFU: Drain a block of firm tofu with a Tofu Press, or by placing a weight on it for 30 mins. Then shred the tofu to make it crumbly.\nWET MIXTURE: In a bowl, combine 1/2 tsp turmeric powder, 1/2 tsp paprika, 1 Tbsp tahini, 2 Tbsp nutritional yeast and 1/2 cup plant-based milk of our choice. Optionally add 1/4 tsp kala namak (Himalayan Black Salt) for flavor. Stir well into a creamy mixture. Set aside.\nCOOK: In a pan, saut\u00e9 crumbled tofu with 1/2 cup red onion (finely chopped) and 1 jalape\u00f1o (minced) for a few minutes. Then add the Wet Mixture set aside to cooked tofu. Mix well and cook for a few more minutes. Scrambled tofu is ready!",
  "cooking_methods": [
    "saut\u00e9",
    "no-cook",
    "blend"
  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "On Ezekiel 4:9 bread!",
  "notes": "A recipe with WHOLE GRAINS (Ezekiel 4:9 bread), BEANS (Ezekiel 4:9 bread, firm tofu), RAINBOW VEGGIES (onion, jalape\u00f1o), NUTS & SEEDS (tahini, nut-based or seed-based milk), HERBS & SPICES (various).",
